## Relationship Set

`containsMany` of typed relations (duplicate-of / caused-by / blocks / blocked-by / related-to / follows-up) with target id+title, note and attribution. The target is an id plus title rather than a link, so a relation list renders without loading every target; the id is what a query joins on. The type is data; nothing names a domain.

```ts
import { RelationshipSetField } from '@cardstack/catalog/fields/relationship-set/relationship-set-field';

@field relations = contains(RelationshipSetField);
```

### Non-goals

Not bidirectional bookkeeping — the inverse edge is derived by query, never mirrored by hand. `containsMany`-of-links cannot be JSON-patched: writers mutate + SaveCard.
